Ever tried "the archeologist dive" ?  That's where you do
for(i=0; i<30; i++)
	apply(pick-axe,">");
and end up in the maze (picking up anything valuable on the
way).  It could be considered a cheat that you can get a score
of over 3000 without doing any *serious* exploring, just a 
one-way dive...

